1
00:00:00,365 --> 00:00:01,365
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

2
00:00:03,285 --> 00:00:05,165
- Hey.
- Hey.

3
00:00:05,329 --> 00:00:07,369
(Leonard:)A little mood lighting, huh?

4
00:00:07,539 --> 00:00:10,749
(Penny:)Yeah. When I didn't pay my bill,
the Department of Water and Power...

5
00:00:10,917 --> 00:00:13,667
(Penny:)...thought I would enjoy the ambience.

6
00:00:14,379 --> 00:00:17,299
(Leonard:)Yeah, they're very considerate that way.

7
00:00:17,466 --> 00:00:21,636
(Penny:)I used Sheldon's money to pay my rent.
Then I had, like, $14 left over.

8
00:00:22,846 --> 00:00:25,266
(Leonard:)Fourteen dollars, huh?

9
00:00:25,641 --> 00:00:28,981
(Penny:)Put it back in your pocket
or I'll find another place to put it.

10
00:00:30,103 --> 00:00:32,483
(Leonard:)Back in the pocket it goes.

11
00:00:32,898 --> 00:00:36,528
(Leonard:)Look, you do understand that Sheldon
doesn't care when he gets the money back.

12
00:00:36,693 --> 00:00:38,863
(Leonard:)It's actually one
of the few idiosyncrasies...

13
00:00:39,029 --> 00:00:42,029
...that doesn't make you wanna,
you know, kill him.

14
00:00:42,491 --> 00:00:44,911
(Penny:)Yeah, well,
that's not really my big problem.

15
00:00:45,077 --> 00:00:48,327
(Leonard:)You're a little behind on your bills.
Everybody gets behind on bills.

16
00:00:48,497 --> 00:00:50,667
(Penny:)Yeah, I know, it's just...
This wasn't the plan.

17
00:00:51,083 --> 00:00:52,663
(Penny:)It wasn't supposed to go this way.

18
00:00:52,834 --> 00:00:55,084
Hey, well, what was the plan?

